00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.546
Virtual reality
is the promise of a fully immersive,

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:50.091
interconnected universe
that transcends physical limitations.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:54.721
a world unbound by gravity,
material limitations or cost.

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:57.515
Sounds kind of like the dream, right?

00:00:57.515 --> 00:01:02.353
Augmented reality is even more interesting
because it can enhance our physical

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:07.400
